  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of the crossover distributing on to a classified road would prejudice highway safety, prevent free flow of traffic, pedestrians and cyclists movement, result in the overhanging of vehicles on to the adopted highway and loss of parking spaces. As such the development would be contrary to Policies 6.9, 6.10 and 6.13 of the London Plan (2016), Policy CP25 of the Core Strategy (2010), Policies DMD 45 and DMD 46 of the Enfield Development Management Plan (2014) and Council's Technical Footway Guidance 2013.",
